Key Features of the Countdown Component
 * Eye-Catching Design: Uses a dark, gradient background with glowing text and animated boxes to draw attention.
 * Dynamic Calculation: Accurately calculates the time remaining and updates every second.
 * Celebration Effect: Once the timer hits zero, it triggers a full-screen confetti and ribbon burst using react-confetti. 🎊
 * Responsive: The layout adjusts for different screen sizes using Material-UI's Grid system.
 * Reusable: It's a self-contained component that only requires the liveStatus object as a prop.
 * Smooth Animations: Utilizes CSS keyframes for subtle animations on the timer boxes and text, making it feel more dynamic.
